he points on and above this boundary line, it follows that the graph represents all the solutions to the inequality <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="y greater than or equals 36"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>36</mn></math>.</p>
