o>\n<mn>20</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>, yields <math alttext=\"x plus 7 left parenthesis 9 x plus 12 right parenthesis equals 20\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math>, which gives <math alttext=\"x plus 63 x plus 84 equals 20\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"64 x plus 84 equals 20\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>64</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>84</mn>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>20</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"84\"><mn>84</mn>\n</math> from each side of this equation yields <math alttext=\"64 x equals negative 64\"><mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>64</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>64</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Dividing each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"x equals negative 1\"><mrow>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"negative 1\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in the first equation in the system, <math alttext=\"y equals 9 x plus 12\"><mrow>\n<mi>y</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mrow>\n<mn>9</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mn>12</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>, yields <math alttext=\"y equals 9 left parenthesis negative 1 right parenthesis plus 12\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"y equals 3\"><mrow>\n<mi>y</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>3</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math>.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1743430554